WEBVTT

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.560
Leave the group...?

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.400
That's right.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.270
Shizuku, Chisa, you two as well.

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.150
What?

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.690
Us, too...?

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:21.520
I want the three of you to form a new group.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.520
What?!

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:03.440
I've been thinking for a while now about
how to bring out the best in each of you.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:10.020
Hoshimi Productions will launch two groups--
with Kotono and Sakura as the leaders.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:13.150
I know that everyone may feel
startled over this sudden decision.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.100
But I want you to believe in this decision.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.600
I'm... the leader?

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.560
Will you tell us your reasoning?

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.230
That's...

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:23.810
Did you really think we would agree

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.560
to your unilateral decision
without some sort of justification?

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.770
We've been working hard all this time together.

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.810
Are you saying that this group isn't working?

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:50.100
Kotono and Sakura, I think each of you
has your own unique strengths.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:55.230
You have to be separated in order for each
of your lights to shine the brightest.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.230
Like the moon and sun.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.650
The moon...

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.100
And sun?

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.350
That's right.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:03.980
The moon and sun exist far from each other.

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.020
The world of day and night...

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:09.310
They bring each other out
because they're separated that way.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.350
And each of your lights will illuminate

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:18.100
Mei, Suzu, Nagisa, Saki, Chisa,
and Shizuku brilliantly.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.600
Quietly... yet vividly.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.150
Powerfully and warmly...

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:29.940
I regret not coming up
with this idea from the start.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.150
I'm sorry.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.850
If you've really thought this through,
there's no objection on my part.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:36.730
What?

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.350
I agree, too!

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:41.850
If you think you are too burdened,
I can switch places with you.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:43.850
Suzu...

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.600
I think they're both suited
to be the leaders, too.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.190
Nagisa...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:50.480
Are you two okay with it?

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.770
Yup.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.440
How about you, Chisa?

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.940
Y-Yup...

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:58.190
Okay.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.480
Kotono...

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.230
I believe in you, Mr. Makino.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.900
Please make us both shine brilliantly.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.350
I will.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:12.100
Hey, so is Sakura's group only three members?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.730
Actually, I've scouted a new member.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.190
I'll introduce her tomorrow.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:21.350
Come on in, both of you.

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:27.690
Hey!

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:29.690
A student from our school?

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:32.310
I'll be working with you all starting today.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.940
I'm Haruko Saeki,

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.940
I'm 17 years old!

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.770
I-I'm 17 years...

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.600
Old!

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:45.940
Miss Haruko...

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.940
What is with that outfit?

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.730
Well since I'm 17!

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.600
She is the office worker, is she not?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.770
Office worker...?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.020
No.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.100
She's one of our idols here.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.900
I never got popular, though.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.350
Weren't you two school grades below my sister?

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:05.310
So that would make you... 20?

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.730
Haruko Saeki... She came up.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:10.650
Only three hits... though...

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:12.770
B-But you look great in that uniform!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.810
I really thought you were 17!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.980
Yeah, you're so cute!

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.480
Like a real student!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.900
Like a real...?

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.400
Are you done?

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.150
Y-Yup, go on, take it away.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:26.810
I'm Rei Ichinose, 18 years old.

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.730
My specialty is dancing.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:32.730
Rei's won first place in the
national dance competition, too!

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.060
Amazing, right?

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.980
National competition...

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.600
How did Mr. Makino scout
such a talented person...?

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.690
I'm the one who gave him the tip!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:44.770
She would always watch me practice.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:48.480
She's the reason why I met Mr. Makino.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.190
Hoshimi Productions?

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.850
So you represent an entertainment agency?

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:58.230
I'm in the middle of forming a new idol group.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.850
Idol...?

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.190
May I join the agency, too?

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.980
And that's why you're here?

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:08.980
Yes.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.150
I've seen Rei dance, too.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.190
I'd say her ability is impeccable.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:16.690
Miss Haruko's taken lessons
diligently for years, too.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.190
So her singing and dancing are at a high level.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.440
With the both of them,
Sakura, Chisa and Shizuku...

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.400
I think the five of you will become a group

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.270
that illuminates each other's
strengths to the fullest.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.440
This five of us, a group?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.730
Are you the leader?

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.400
Yup! I am.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.100
I see.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.270
I'm here because I heard you
were all aiming for the top as idols.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:42.100
It's great to meet you all.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.270
Yup! Glad to have you!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.310
--Will you teach me how to dance?
--Will I be able to dance like her, too?
--So it's the five of us now.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:49.440
--I'm looking forward to working with you all.
--Likewise. I'm looking forward to it.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:02.520
Chisa, is something on your mind?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.850
You seemed down all day today...

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:08.600
Is it because I'm the leader?

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.350
No, it's not.

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:11.270
It's just...

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.480
It's just?

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.900
I'm not in the same group
as my sister anymore...

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.730
And as far as dancing and singing,
I'm behind everyone.

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:26.020
I'm worried I won't make it
as an idol by myself...

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.690
Chisa...

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.690
You're not by yourself.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.400
We're all doing this together!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:38.020
We've got this!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.400
I'm here, too...

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.520
Yeah... Thanks.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.860
Hoshimi Productions

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.860
Hoshimi Productions

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.860
Hoshimi Productions

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.270
I am exhausted.

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:54.400
I bet you are, Suzu.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.190
You were working hard.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:59.480
Yes, while I let Kotono
take the leader position,

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.480
I have yet to give up on
becoming the center idol.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:06.810
On the day of our debut,
the idol world will be shaken.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:10.650
Suzu Narumiya will shine in Hoshimi City!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:14.150
Then let's first remember the
choreography to make that happen.

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:15.350
Right, Kotono?

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:16.600
Huh?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.730
Oh...

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.020
Yeah.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:22.400
Suzu, you were sloppy in
a few sections of the dance,

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.940
so you were out of sync with everyone.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.480
What is it?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:32.100
Kotono, you were frowning
all throughout practice.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:33.060
What?

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.270
Idols are always smiling
when they're singing, right?

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.730
So you better smile, Kotono!

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:39.850
Hey! Mei! Wait!

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:43.400
H-Hey... Q-Q-Quit it...!

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:40.770
Oh?

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:43.400
Like this? Like this?

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:46.150
Look at her face!

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.770
That's a funny face, Kotono.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.770
But it's kind of cute.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.940
They love it!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:53.730
They love it, Kotono!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.400
You should get changed already.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.980
Okay!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.600
Wow!

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.690
That's what experience looks like...

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.310
I've been taking lessons for a while now.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:16.190
But I'm still not as sharp as Rei.

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:21.020
Miss Saeki, you have a habit of moving
your limbs first when you move left and right.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.650
It would help if you were more
mindful of your body's center.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.770
I-I see.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:26.900
Interesting.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:29.690
Miss Kawasaki, you tend to rush the tempo.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:33.810
Miss Hyodo, you've got great rhythm,
but your movements are small.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:36.440
You should make bigger movements.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.180
Yes!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.310
O-Okay.

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:39.940
And Miss Shiraishi.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:40.810
Yes?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.310
You tend to lag behind because
you try to follow the others.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.810
If you don't dance on the beat,

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.850
you'll appear out of sync on stage.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.560
Y-Yes...

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.150
Let's try it again.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.230
What? Already?

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.440
Let's not waste any practice
time sitting around.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:57.900
Come on, stand up!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.230
Y-Yes!

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:01.060
Wow, so strict!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.980
Thank you.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.100
I appreciate it.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.310
Seems like you've gathered quite the characters.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:11.350
Yes.

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.400
Because I was fortunate to meet them,

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.520
I was able to set my mind on
separating Kotono and Sakura.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:21.480
Even I was surprised when you said you
were going to split the group in two.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:25.520
I didn't think you would
approve of it so readily, either.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.020
Thank you very much.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:33.100
Your vision of the new Hoshimi Productions
idol is beginning to take shape.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.020
Yes.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:37.650
Well, if they come together, that is.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.060
Right...

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:42.310
This is where you show your faith, Makino!

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.690
Right.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:49.020
Did you make this coffee, Mr. Saegusa?

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:50.600
Yeah.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.310
It's pretty bitter.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:53.690
Sure is.

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.190
My body hurts...

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:02.020
Let's ice ourselves again.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.560
We need to soothe our muscles
that worked so hard.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.270
Th-Thank you very much...

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.100
Is everyone all right?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.810
Yup, we're hanging in there.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.150
Okay.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.310
This is for everyone.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.690
There were sections that
weren't mastered yet today,

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.560
so please review them before our next practice.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:21.490
What?

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.520
Right... now...?

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.400
I've got a matter to attend to,
so I'll be leaving now.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.440
What? How about dinner?

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:31.810
I'll be eating over there,
so please don't worry.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:34.520
I don't think you'll see me
here at night too much.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.690
Goodbye.

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.690
A matter to attend to this late?

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.730
She's so mysterious.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.900
<i>Idoly Pride.</i>

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.690
How's practice?

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:50.520
Huh?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.270
Are you able to keep up with everyone?

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:54.690
Yeah...

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.270
I'm okay...

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.440
Are you sure?

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.690
Yup.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.020
I'm fine. Don't worry about me...

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.810
Miss Rei, stop! Hold on!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:20.440
We already took a break an hour ago.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.150
But we're still not ready to dance
through the whole practice yet.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:27.350
You and I are used to dancing so we're fine,

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.230
but the others are still beginners,

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.980
so it could be good to take it a little easier.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.480
Will you be saying that on stage, too?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.600
What?

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:40.350
Will the other idols take it easy on us, too?

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.480
Once we debut, we're all professionals.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.060
That's...

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:47.150
I saw the video of the
joint lesson with LizNoir.

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:50.940
To be honest, I was shocked
to see where everyone was at.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.270
In order to surpass them
starting from this point,

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:55.940
I don't think we can afford to take any breaks.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:12:59.730
Miss Rei...

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:04.980
You're able to think like that
because you can actually dance.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.310
Chisa...

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:09.980
I started out as a beginner myself, too.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.770
Then why...

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.730
How did you come to be like that?

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.270
I don't give up,

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.150
I keep practicing,

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.480
and I don't stop once I start.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.520
I'm not able to do the same as you.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:29.940
I was with my sister...
I want to be with my sister...

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:35.600
So I don't see myself being able
to do this right now...

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.150
When you haven't done anything yet?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:41.270
Do you really like idols?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.810
Let's call it a day for today.

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:49.100
It won't do us any good if we
keep practicing like this.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.400
Mr. Makino, is that all right?

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.440
Yeah.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:55.190
Rei and Chisa, is that all right?

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:56.600
That's fine.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.980
Yes.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:02.100
If we're done, I'll be excusing myself.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.770
What? Will you be late again tonight?

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.560
Yes... Thank you for today.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.900
Chisa and Shizuku, what do you feel like eating?

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:21.270
When you feel down, you gotta fill
yourself up with your favorite food!

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:22.770
Let's buy it on our way back.

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.100
Then...

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:24.980
Bananas...

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.600
<i>Mille</i> crepe...

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.980
Sounds good.

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:29.270
How about you, Sakura?

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:33.520
Were you thinking about Rei just now?

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.690
Yes.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:36.810
I'm curious about a lot of things.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.770
Like, where does she go after practice?

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.650
Why does she want to become an idol?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.560
Why is she in such a rush?

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.980
In a rush...?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.600
Yup, it's hard to say,

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.810
but she reminds me of Kotono from before.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:56.440
Maybe Miss Rei also has an
important reason to become an idol.

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.690
An important reason...?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.000
Food
Super
Market

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:01.850
What should I get?

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.560
Thank you very much.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:06.480
Next customer, please!

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.060
Thank you for waiting.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:10.270
Would you like a bag?

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.770
Oh my gosh, could that be...?

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.650
It's pretty clear.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:15.730
It's Miss Rei.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:19.350
Miss Rei has a part-time job?!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.480
One daikon radish and three onions.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.940
The total comes out to...

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.690
What?!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.560
E-Excuse me.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.730
Your total comes out to 104,700 yen.

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:32.190
...100,000 yen?!

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.100
I-I'm very sorry!

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:42.190
I can't believe you were working part-time
at a supermarket so close to us.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.980
I started right before I moved into the dorms.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:48.150
I'm usually working in the back,

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.980
but I've been put on
cashier duty starting today.

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:55.060
I didn't expect to be caught on the same day.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:56.770
Why were you hiding this?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.350
I didn't want you all to worry about me.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.440
What... do you mean?

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.850
Tell us why.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.060
I want to know more about you, Miss Rei.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:10.020
We're in a group together!

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.940
Okay.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:19.150
To be honest, initially,
I didn't want to become an idol.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.230
I don't have any dreams of becoming one, either.

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:24.100
Really...?

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.440
I've loved dancing all my life.

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:30.060
And I've dreamed of making it my profession.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:33.190
But my parents wouldn't approve of it.

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.850
Even when you won the dance competition?!

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:40.520
If I go off the path they set for me,
they won't be happy.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:44.060
My parents won't approve,
no matter how well I dance.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.690
But if I reach the top as an idol
and get the public's approval,

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.440
even they would have to approve.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.690
That's why I decided to become an idol.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.940
But since I left the house like that,

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:59.480
I can't get any support from them,
nor will I accept any.

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.940
That's why I started working here.

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:03.730
I see...

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.980
I'm going to go back since
my break is about to end.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:07.900
Okay!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.560
Good luck!

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:12.850
That's amazing...

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.600
I would've given up already if I were her.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:18.810
I'm so full of fear right now...

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:20.690
Chisa...

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.400
I'm sure Rei is scared, too.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.980
There's no guarantee that she will succeed.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.560
That's why she practices so much.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:33.810
Over and over again, to vanish those fears.

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.400
Fears...

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.730
Sakura?

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:44.560
Morning, Kotono!

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:47.520
I saw Mr. Makino leave just a moment ago.

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:49.900
He was in a suit, so it must be work.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:53.520
But it's the weekend! How tough...

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.900
Was something on your mind?

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:59.310
It just seemed like it...

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:00.770
Yup.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.730
Will you lend me an ear?

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:06.190
Miss Ichinose and Chisa, huh?

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:07.150
Yup.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:11.060
Miss Rei seems so busy, so I haven't
been able to talk to her too much.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.350
I'm not sure what to do.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:16.060
Saki's worried about Chisa, too.

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:17.520
She seems to have her mind set

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.190
on not interfering in matters
of the other group, though.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:21.980
Oh, really?

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:24.900
She's not present during practice at times.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.650
That leaves only Nagisa and me as the ones
who have to keep a handle on Mei,

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.190
so it's been a challenge.

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:31.520
You've been doing that, Kotono?

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.940
Why are you so surprised?

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.100
Because...

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:37.350
You're thinking that it's unlike me, right?

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:40.150
Sorry.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.190
I am the leader, after all...

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:45.060
It's scary, but I need to do my best.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.730
I see.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.600
I've gotta do my best, too!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.310
Everyone!

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:09.900
Come see this!

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:17.270
Right? Isn't it amazing?!

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.850
This flower...

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:20.230
It's the nemophila.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:25.440
But was it necessary to interrupt
practice to come see this?

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:28.600
Yup, this is really important for us.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.480
Now, here's a question!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.900
What is the flower language
behind the nemophila?

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.940
Flower language...?

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.230
"Success everywhere"...

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:42.230
That's right! Those are just the words
we need, don't you think?

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.230
Success... everywhere...

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:46.350
You're right.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:50.770
When you see them in full bloom like this,
it feels really encouraging!

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.060
Miss Rei, I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:57.940
What?

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:04.350
I gave up and told myself I couldn't do it
before I even tried to work hard like you.

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:07.650
But I know I can't keep this up, either.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:11.310
So, will you keep teaching me about dance?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.100
Miss Chisa...

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.940
B-B-But Miss Rei...

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.730
Will you be a little less strict...?

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.060
Please...

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.560
I agree.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:25.650
Rei can be a little scary during practice.

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:28.230
Spartan style... Demon coach.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.650
The pressure is immense.

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:30.940
What?

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:32.190
See? That pressure.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:34.400
Yup, yup, yup, yup...

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.730
Oh, yeah!

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.400
You think so, too, Miss Kawasaki?

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:39.600
I know!

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:40.980
Let's stop being formal, too.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:43.770
It feels like it creates a little distance.

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.020
But...

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:46.520
I agree!

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:50.020
You can all call me "Haruko" from now on!

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.650
What? But Miss Haruko, you're our senior...

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:54.730
No, I'm your fellow!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.600
But...

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.690
Just call me "Haruko"!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.850
H-Haruko!

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.440
There you go!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.440
Go on, the rest of you!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.270
What...?

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:04.690
That's a bit...

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:07.230
But why?!

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.270
Okay.

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:12.480
Sakura.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.940
Shizuku.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.100
Chisa.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:16.600
Miss Haruko.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:18.480
Was that okay?

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.060
Yeah!

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:21.900
What?

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.600
Isn't it weird that I'm the only one
addressed with "Miss"?

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:27.730
I can't bring myself to
address my senior without it.

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:28.770
What?

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:32.690
Sakura, do something!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.150
What?!

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:32.690
Is it my fault?

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:35.350
Hey, Chisa and Shizuku!

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:09.400
Mr. Makino, we're ready!

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:11.350
All right.

00:23:11.350 --> 00:23:14.980
Hey! There you are!
What are you doing?!

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:16.650
A group photo?

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:17.900
Nice!

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:21.020
I wanna be in it, too!

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:22.400
Mei, wait!

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.520
Don't get in the way!

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:28.350
I am sure you want me in the center, right?

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:29.690
Suzu, not you, too.

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:30.810
It's fine!

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:32.190
Let's all take one together!

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:33.810
Gosh.

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:42.650
All right, ready?

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:47.150
Separate Lights, One Feeling
